<Base title="About Local Chatbot Builders" description="Local Chatbot Builders is an early-stage service that sets up FAQ and lead-capture chatbots for local businesses. How we work and what we do not claim." path="about/">
  <section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">About</span><h1>About Local Chatbot Builders</h1></div></section>
  <div class="wrap"><div class="prose">
    <p>Local Chatbot Builders sets up website chatbots for local businesses so common questions get answered and enquiries are collected, using answers the business approves.</p>
    <h2>Where we are</h2>
    <p>This is an early version of the service. We have no client results, reviews or case studies to show, and we do not publish statistics or outcome claims. If a fact cannot be sourced and dated, we leave it out.</p>
    <h2>Principles</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The bot only uses answers the business has approved.</li>
      <li>No invented prices, testimonials or results.</li>
      <li>Quotes are individual; nothing is priced on this site.</li>
      <li>We keep customer data handling minimal. See the Privacy page.</li>
    </ul>
  </div></div>
</Base>
